{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contents may include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pond full of fish,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690070/extras/TopDescription.gif?t=1747971885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hungry, hungry black hole,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690070/extras/MiddleDescription.gif?t=1747971885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgradeable spawners to keep the pond topped up,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690070/extras/ThirdDescription.gif?t=1747971885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And an infinite supply of fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690070/extras/FinalDescription.gif?t=1747971885\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to catch fish the old fashioned way. That doesn't work, so use a black-hole fueled whirlpool instead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your fish to make a bigger and bigger whirlpool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drain the pond - only to discover another pond below the pond!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's ponds all the way down - re-play the demo level as many times as you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Estimated demo completion time: 1-2 hours.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690070?t=1747971885","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690070?t=1747971885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams